---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Ruckus Systems"
  description="How Ruckus Systems collects, uses, and protects information on ruckussystems.dev, including analytics and booking."
>
  <div class="privacy-root">
    <a href="/" class="privacy-back-link">← Back to Home</a>

    <article class="privacy-main">
      <h1 class="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-meta">
        <strong>Ruckus Systems LLC</strong> · Effective June 26, 2026 ·
        <a href="mailto:jared@ruckussystems.dev">jared@ruckussystems.dev</a>
      </p>
      <p class="privacy-meta">
        See also our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.
      </p>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Ruckus Systems LLC operates <a href="https://ruckussystems.dev">ruckussystems.dev</a>, a
          marketing and services website for software development, data engineering, and AI
          automation consulting based in Asheville, NC. This policy describes how we handle
          information when you visit the site, book a session, or contact us.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Examples</th>
              <th>Source</th>
              <th>Purpose</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Website usage</td>
              <td>Pages viewed, referrer, device/browser type, approximate location</td>
              <td>Analytics tools</td>
              <td>Understand traffic, improve the site, measure marketing</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Booking</td>
              <td>Name, email, phone, appointment time, service selected</td>
              <td>Online scheduling flow</td>
              <td>Confirm and manage booked sessions</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Payments</td>
              <td>Payment amount, transaction metadata (not full card numbers)</td>
              <td>Stripe checkout for tips or paid bookings</td>
              <td>Process voluntary tips and paid session fees</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Contact</td>
              <td>Email address, message content</td>
              <td>Email or other direct outreach you initiate</td>
              <td>Respond to inquiries</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We use third-party analytics and advertising technologies that may set cookies or
          similar identifiers in your browser, including:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Vercel Analytics</strong> — aggregated page-view and performance metrics</li>
          <li><strong>Google tag (gtag.js)</strong> — conversion and campaign measurement</li>
          <li><strong>LinkedIn Insight Tag</strong> — audience and campaign analytics for LinkedIn ads</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These providers may collect usage data according to their own privacy policies. You can
          limit tracking through your browser settings, ad-blockers, or the opt-out tools offered
          by each provider.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>What we do not do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> sell personal information.</li>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> use site analytics data to build unrelated advertising profiles.</li>
          <li>We do <strong>not</strong> store full payment card numbers — Stripe handles card data.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Provider</th>
              <th>Purpose</th>
              <th>Data shared</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Vercel</td>
              <td>Site hosting and analytics</td>
              <td>Request metadata, aggregated usage</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Google</td>
              <td>Advertising and conversion measurement</td>
              <td>Usage and campaign interaction data</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>LinkedIn</td>
              <td>Marketing analytics</td>
              <td>Usage and ad interaction data</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Stripe</td>
              <td>Payment processing</td>
              <td>Payment and customer contact details for transactions</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Ruckus booking platform</td>
              <td>Scheduling and session management</td>
              <td>Booking details you submit</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Analytics data is retained according to each provider's default periods.</li>
          <li>Booking records are kept as needed to deliver services and meet business obligations.</li>
          <li>Email correspondence is retained while relevant to an ongoing inquiry or relationship.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may request access, correction, or deletion of personal information we hold by
          contacting <a href="mailto:jared@ruckussystems.dev">jared@ruckussystems.dev</a>. We will
          respond within a reasonable timeframe. Residents of certain jurisdictions may have
          additional rights under applicable privacy laws.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Privacy questions or requests:
          <a href="mailto:jared@ruckussystems.dev">jared@ruckussystems.dev</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="privacy-disclaimer">
        This policy describes Ruckus Systems' practices for ruckussystems.dev. It does not
        constitute legal advice and may be updated from time to time.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-root {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .privacy-back-link:hover {
    color: var(--solar-blue);
  }

  .privacy-main {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-main {
      padding: 3rem;
    }
  }

  .privacy-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-meta {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .privacy-meta a {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .privacy-meta a:hover {
    color: var(--solar-blue);
  }

  .privacy-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  .privacy-section p,
  .privacy-section li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .privacy-section a {
    color: var(--solar-blue);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .privacy-section a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  th,
  td {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  th {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .privacy-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
